# Environment Variables Configuration
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: This portfolio is fully self-contained and statically prerendered.
# It does NOT require any mandatory environment variables to build or run on Vercel.
# 
# OPTIONAL VARIABLES:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL: Optional canonical URL for production (e.g. https://lokenderrao.vercel.app or your custom domain).
# If omitted, relative paths are used without hardcoded domains.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.com
